---
/*
  The spine: one vertical hairline running the full height of the document,
  offset into the left margin (DESIGN-PLAN section 4, concept A). It is the
  recurring structural mark of the whole site, and it is purely decorative, so
  it is hidden from assistive technology.

  It spans the frame element it is placed in, which wraps the entire page, so it
  runs to the true document height rather than one viewport.
*/
---

<div class="hairline-v pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 left-spine" aria-hidden="true"></div>
